digraph workflows {
  graph [rankdir=BT, newrank=true, bgcolor="white", fontname="sans-serif",
    fontsize=11, nodesep=0.18, ranksep=0.34, pad=0.15,
    label="Workflow migration · prerequisites → dependent\nBlocked ≠ running · parked routes are unselected · thesis STOPPED", labelloc=b];
  node [shape=box, style="rounded,filled", fontname="sans-serif",
    fontsize=12, margin="0.08,0.06", width=1.4];
  edge [color="#78818a", arrowsize=0.6, penwidth=1.0];
  "workflow-done" [label="PROJECT DONE\nWorkflow migration\nBLOCKED", shape=doubleoctagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Selected project-local skills and workflow deliverables integrated and working against the agreed support contract, with evidence and caveats retained; all assignments closed and their sessions released. Plans alone do not establish readiness. Thesis execution remains STOPPED.\nblocker: Selected completion package and acceptance criteria are not agreed; delivery, acceptance and session release remain unfinished.\nSources: docs/development-environments.md, docs/coordination/handoff.md", penwidth=2, fontsize=14];
  "workflow-selection" [label="Select completion\npackage\nBLOCKED", shape=hexagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Coordinator presents consolidated alternatives, expected outcomes, resource estimates, limitations and precise activation/acceptance scope. Jörn selects migration/knowledge scope and substantial expenditure; retain/defer is a valid explicit disposition.\nblocker: Returned proposals and completed route/accounting recommendations need coordinator integration into one reviewable package; Jörn has not selected its scope, substantial expenditure or acceptance criteria.\nplan_gap: No complete selected implementation/acceptance package exists. Proposal estimates are not authorization; readiness must not silently mean every proposed feature or pilot.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md, docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md, AGENTS.md.commentary.md"];
  "workflow-delivery" [label="Selected package\ndelivered\nBLOCKED", shape=box, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Integrate the selected project-local skills, discovery adapters and other concrete workflow deliverables; retain explicitly accepted deferrals for additional capabilities. Assign owned implementation steps and checks after selection. Plans alone cannot close delivery.\nblocker: No implementation/activation package selected; selected communication acceptance is unfinished. Dashboard/map delivery is complete; historical transport cause can remain unknown.\nplan_gap: Implementation owners, concrete change list and receiving/review responsibilities must follow selection. This placeholder does not authorize migration, evaluations or host/cloud setup.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md, docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md"];
  "workflow-acceptance" [label="Readiness evidence\nBLOCKED", shape=box, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Check selected artifacts and relevant client/environment routes, retain unavailable checks and behavioral limits, and obtain review of the resulting bounded readiness claim. No full thesis checks are implied.\nblocker: Selected acceptance criteria and delivered candidate are absent.\nplan_gap: Fresh Codex/Claude discovery and selected remote handoff/review checks are unperformed. A behavioral pilot is optional until selected; structural checks alone do not establish reliable behavior.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md, docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md, docs/development-environments.md"];
  "workflow-session-release" [label="Sessions released\nBLOCKED", shape=box, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Coordinator integrates outcomes, records any pending decisions with a receiving owner, closes completed assignments and releases their sessions. Do not confuse an idle planner with an active owner.\nblocker: Coordinator integration and selected workflow delivery/acceptance remain unfinished; bounded worker assignments have ended.\nSources: docs/coordination/README.md"];
  "workflow-communication-acceptance" [label="Communication\nacceptance\nBLOCKED", shape=hexagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Verify bounded message/return delivery for the selected workflow paths, or retain a specifically accepted limitation. Native bounded worker send/return delivery succeeded in this window; legacy independent-session send receipt remains unverified.\nblocker: Required communication paths and their acceptance contract have not been selected; native packet delivery does not establish legacy MCP send recovery.\nplan_gap: Native subagent send/return worked. Original independent-thread endpoint failure cause lacks evidence; current read connectivity does not prove sends or receipt. Select whether retained-file/manual receipt suffices or a bounded live send/ack test is required.\nSources: docs/development-environments.md"];
  "__completed" [label="DONE · owners released\nShared coordination\nLocal guidance\nWorkstation OTel\nSkill proposal\nKnowledge proposal\nProposal integration\nGoal and dependency view\nSupport-route proposal\nAccounting proposal\nCompletion map", fontsize=11, fillcolor="#e7f1e8", color="#93918c", tooltip="Separate coordination, browser views and reusable knowledge\nCanonical coordination and browser source contract complete; five HTTP checks passed. Prior Chrome inspection unavailable.\nSources: docs/coordination/README.md, docs/coordination/thesis-work.md, docs/coordination/handoff.md\n\nRoute process knowledge into project collaboration guidance\nLocal collaboration rules and knowledge routing complete; link/state checks passed. Behavioral and post-compaction performance untested.\nSources: AGENTS.md, AGENTS.md.commentary.md, docs/knowledge/README.md\n\nSet up authorized workstation-only OpenObserve telemetry\nLive workstation logs/traces/metrics API-verified after daemon restart. Host implementation complete; maintenance belongs to ~/.dotfiles/INSTALL.md. Browser login unverified.\nSources: docs/development-environments.md, docs/coordination/otel-design.md\n\nPrepare repository-owned skill migration\nReviewable local skill/discovery migration proposal returned; planner assignment ended. Candidate, activation and fresh-client acceptance remain unselected.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md\n\nPlan process-knowledge cleanup and behavioural evaluation\nReviewable two-link cleanup and bounded forward-pilot proposal returned; planner assignment ended. Cleanup and pilot remain unselected.\nSources: docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md\n\nReview and consolidate returned skill and knowledge proposals\nReviewed migration and knowledge proposals against returned environment/accounting findings. Recommend nine project-local skills with Claude adapters, conditional host capabilities and retained-packet handoffs; defer controlled behavioral pilot and new messaging infrastructure. Concrete package selection remains Jörn’s decision; no skill activation or execution approval is inferred.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md, docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md\n\nRemaining workflow dependencies visible in the dashboard\nDashboard exposes goal, unfinished dependencies, planning gaps and parked routes; native-width graph has a goal-centered viewport. Local desktop and 390px mobile reviews passed; phone graph requires panning. Source/path/HTTP checks passed. Coordinator owns integration.\nSources: docs/coordination/README.md\n\nDefine support and handoff routes across selected environments\nRead-only supported-route matrix returned: local .agents source plus proposed Claude links/import; retained packets and manual host handoff initially. Independent-thread live delivery and SSH persistence remain unverified; Codex Cloud privileged-image/R2 bootstrap assumptions are not validated for Claude.\nplan_gap: Claude fresh-clone setup/discovery, cloud-to-host handoff, remote-device review access and reconnect/session continuity have no agreed acceptance route. Required support versus explicitly deferred capabilities is unresolved.\nSources: docs/development-environments.md, docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md\n\nDefine truthful usage and spending observations\nRead-only recommendation returned: current.json and retained outcomes own durable PM state; OpenObserve is diagnostic. Optional explicit packet-event JSONL-to-OTel helper only if selected; no broker/database. Token/time observations are not billing; quota/USD unknown and independent-root/cloud usage is not covered.\nplan_gap: Comparable cloud/Pro usage, semantic task/message journaling and budget-enforcement mechanics are undefined. Numeric thresholds are not agreed; the selected delivery may explicitly defer automation.\nSources: AGENTS.md.commentary.md, docs/development-environments.md\n\nCompletion map and graph projection retained\nGoal/dependency map retained in canonical JSON with explicit planning gaps and parked routes; DOT/SVG project shared state with a source-hash drift check. Syntax, missing-dependency/cycle rejection, stale DOT/SVG detection and state/path checks passed. Coordinator owns integration and subsequent refresh.\nSources: docs/coordination/README.md"];
  "__parked" [label="UNSELECTED / PARKED · no execution\nCommunication diagnosis · BLOCKED\nSkill migration candidate · PARKED\nKnowledge cleanup / pilot · PARKED\nCloud automation · PARKED\nThesis execution STOPPED · PARKED", fontsize=11, fillcolor="#f1f0ed", color="#93918c", tooltip="Determine why agent communication tools failed\nBounded local diagnosis finished. Same daemon persisted through failures; multiple TUI MCP server processes turned over. Stale endpoint binding is plausible, but old-port ownership, shutdown/rebind evidence and original cause are unavailable. Current list verifies reads only.\nblocker: Historical endpoint ownership/binding evidence is unavailable; current successful reads do not establish original cause or legacy send recovery.\nplan_gap: Capture failing URL, socket owner/PID and endpoint-binding lifecycle events on the next natural failure. Do not launch repeated investigation or restart the shared daemon.\nSources: docs/coordination/current.json\n\nOptional local skill candidate, activation and fresh-client tests\nProposed nine-skill local package, Claude discovery adapters and focused acceptance route. Keep outside loaded paths until selected. This is a candidate route, not an assignment.\nplan_gap: Initial instruction was inspect/plan/discuss first; migration and activation selection absent.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md\n\nOptional knowledge cleanup and forward pilot\nChoose retain-and-observe, two-link cleanup only, or cleanup plus bounded A/E pilot. No model calls or cleanup are launched by this plan.\nplan_gap: Scope, owner and resources have not been selected; broader cases and post-compaction validation remain unperformed.\nSources: docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md\n\nPossible cloud communication, setup and accounting automation\nExternal surfaces remain outside workstation telemetry. Live cloud messaging, detailed returned event logs and enforcement are possible mechanisms; required support and value are undecided.\nplan_gap: No agreed need, design, acceptance contract or authorization for cloud automation.\nSources: docs/development-environments.md\n\nThesis execution — STOPPED\nPrevious thesis completion run remains stopped. Backlog availability does not authorize a new execution window.\nSources: docs/coordination/handoff.md"];
  "workflow-acceptance" -> "workflow-done";
